| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Payee      | Destination               | Amount  | Tag    |
| T1  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-10 | Home Depot | Expenses:Home:Maintenance | -100.00 | Rental |
| T2  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-11 | Home Depot | Expenses:Home:Maintenance | -50.00  | none   |
When register opened on : AccountSelect
| Path            |
| Assets:Checking |
Then register lines are : RegisterLine CompareOnly
| Ref | Payee      | Tag    | Payment |
| T1  | Home Depot | Rental | 100.00  |
| T2  | Home Depot | none   | 50.00   |


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A register line can read directly off the new shape
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Description A transaction recorded through SourceAccount/Destination/Amount
\ needs no join against Transactions for its line: it already names its
\ one line directly. See the section on naming both accounts
\ directly in Transactions.spectable.

Scenario A register line reads directly off a transaction recorded the new way
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path               | Type    | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking    | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Groceries | Expense | false       |
Given transactions are : Transaction
| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Payee         | Destination        | Amount |
| T1  | Assets:Checking | 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter | Expenses:Groceries | -45.00 |
When register opened on : AccountSelect
| Path            |
| Assets:Checking |
Then register lines are : RegisterLine
| Ref | Date       | Payee         | Category           | Payment | Deposit | Balance |
| T1  | 2024-01-15 | Harris Teeter | Expenses:Groceries | 45.00   | 0.00    | -45.00  |

Scenario A split recorded the new way shows as Split in the category column
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path                      | Type    | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking           | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Home:Maintenance | Expense | false       |
Given transactions are : Transaction
| Ref | SourceAccount   | Date       | Payee      | Destination | Amount  |
| T1  | Assets:Checking | 2024-04-02 | Home Depot | Split       | -184.50 |
When register opened on : AccountSelect
| Path            |
| Assets:Checking |
Then register lines are : RegisterLine
| Ref | Date       | Payee      | Category  | Payment | Deposit | Balance |
| T1  | 2024-04-02 | Home Depot | --Split-- | 184.50  | 0.00    | -184.50 |
